<div class="setup-page">
  <div class="setup-container">
    <div class="setup-header">
      <div class="setup-icon">
        <svg width="48" height="48" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5">
          <path d="M17 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H5a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"/>
          <circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4"/>
          <path d="M23 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87"/>
          <path d="M16 3.13a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.75"/>
        </svg>
      </div>
      <h1>Set Up Your Faction</h1>
      <p class="setup-subtitle">Faction #<%= @torn_faction_id %></p>
    </div>

    <% if @error.present? %>
      <div class="setup-error">
        <%= @error %>
      </div>
    <% end %>

    <div class="setup-info">
      <p>You're the first person from your faction to use TornManager. Once you complete this setup:</p>

      <ul class="setup-info-list">
        <li>
          <strong>You'll receive leadership permissions</strong> since you're setting up the faction. Under the Leadership dashboard you can invite others. Users with the role Leader or Co-leader are automatically added.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Faction members will be synced</strong> from the Torn API so everyone can access the dashboard.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Ranked war history</strong> will be fetched in the background (~20 API calls).
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Personal stats will be backfilled</strong> for all members from January 1st, 2026. This requires approximately 2 API calls per member per day and may take a while at the rate limit of 60 calls/min.
        </li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <%= form_with url: faction_setup_path, method: :post, class: "setup-form" do |form| %>
      <div class="setup-fields">
        <div class="setup-field">
          <label class="setup-label">
            Limited Access API Key
            <span class="setup-required">Required</span>
          </label>
          <%= form.text_field :api_key,
              value: @api_key_prefill,
              class: "setup-input",
              placeholder: "Enter your Limited Access API key",
              autocomplete: "off",
              required: true %>
          <p class="setup-hint">
            This key is used to fetch faction data (members, wars, personal stats). It must be a <strong>Limited Access</strong> key that belongs to you.
            You can <a href="https://www.torn.com/preferences.php#tab=api" target="_blank">create one in Torn</a> and revoke it at any time.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="setup-actions">
        <%= form.submit "Set Up My Faction", class: "btn btn-primary btn-lg setup-submit" %>
      </div>
    <% end %>

    <details class="setup-details">
      <summary>
        <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
          <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/>
          <path d="M9.09 9a3 3 0 0 1 5.83 1c0 2-3 3-3 3"/>
          <line x1="12" y1="17" x2="12.01" y2="17"/>
        </svg>
        What does the API key do?
      </summary>
      <div class="setup-details-content">
        <div class="setup-detail-item">
          <h4>Faction member sync</h4>
          <p>Fetches the full member list so everyone in your faction can access the dashboard and track their stats.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="setup-detail-item">
          <h4>Personal stats tracking</h4>
          <p>Collects daily training stats (xanax, energy refills, etc.) for compliance tracking. Uses ~2 API calls per member per day.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="setup-detail-item">
          <h4>Ranked war data</h4>
          <p>Fetches war history and live war status for the war dashboard.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="setup-detail-item">
          <h4>Security</h4>
          <p>Your key is stored securely and only used for faction-related API calls. Limited Access keys cannot perform actions on your account. You can revoke it from your Torn settings at any time.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </details>
  </div>
</div>
